# Change Discipline

## Changelog Is Mandatory

Any change that:

- Adds a feature
- Changes behavior
- Fixes a bug
- Refactors architecture
- Improves logging or observability

MUST update `CHANGELOG.md`.

Entries should clearly state:

- What changed
- Why it changed

---

## Roadmap Discipline

- New ideas go ONLY into `roadmap/ROADMAP.md` and/or appropriate feature spec in `roadmap/features/`
- Never partially implement roadmap items silently
- When implementing a roadmap item:
  - Update its status in the roadmap and/or feature spec
  - Reference it in the changelog
